          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d8b2ca7942dc4ca9b79015d544210a56_phase4-b08-d04-despues-hice-un-master-en-edicion-digital.mp3?Expires=1794099808&Signature=oMZz~AeAMgBeTVBVURGkcdzyPLJOl9pZe7UboFQzTox8iqbRzzO9XoF19QT~461h1ESU12TQb7M4Vg6Mr1U6PYrxKIHunwbS3YpmRofFouXGi2pd88c5xaR8FrUquFK5nipWi4P25e-JYWzNITpKsN9lD7atf-eR0fIQ4nDU1U9sC433tQRFtO5fniZcvGXq1vcbJHHJob3~2mFT2Ruy0-MaJcT6Pks-qFbl-M~TLmhDnAysUyMFV9DMkGrLUYbYQy9w~Kji2wvmFMWKPYvg~waY6YJubPf3-q69NBhSpb0XuyPyS8~pdxzOj-5pVF3y9PbXvRQ9t6vJ33RhzViXUw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
